1
00:00:00,659 --> 00:00:02,159
(Penny:)There you go.

2
00:00:02,162 --> 00:00:03,132
You're all done!

3
00:00:03,129 --> 00:00:04,559
(Amy:)That wasn't so bad.

4
00:00:04,564 --> 00:00:05,864
(inhales delightedly)

5
00:00:05,865 --> 00:00:07,465
(Amy:)Nice.

6
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:09,467
(Amy:)Boy, if my mom could see me now,

7
00:00:09,469 --> 00:00:12,069
(Amy:)she'd lock me in the sin closet.

8
00:00:14,139 --> 00:00:15,569
(Bernadette:)That's a joke, right?

9
00:00:15,575 --> 00:00:17,275
(Amy:)Actually, the joke was on her.

10
00:00:17,277 --> 00:00:19,377
(Amy:)I could still see the TV
through the slats.

11
00:00:20,446 --> 00:00:21,946
(Penny:)I'm starting to see

12
00:00:21,948 --> 00:00:24,018
(Penny:)why you and your mom
aren't very close.

13
00:00:24,783 --> 00:00:25,913
(Bernadette:)Bet she'd still tell her

14
00:00:25,919 --> 00:00:27,019
(Bernadette:)if she got married.

15
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,990
(Penny:)You're not gonna
let this go, are you?

16
00:00:28,989 --> 00:00:30,919
(Amy:)Well, it's kind of sad
that they don't know.

17
00:00:30,924 --> 00:00:32,554
(Amy:)I mean, they love Leonard.

18
00:00:32,559 --> 00:00:33,829
(Penny:)Fine, you want
me to call?

19
00:00:33,827 --> 00:00:34,957
(Penny:)I'll call.

20
00:00:34,961 --> 00:00:36,531
(exhales)

21
00:00:36,529 --> 00:00:38,099
(Penny:)Why am I so nervous?

22
00:00:38,098 --> 00:00:39,368
(Bernadette:)It's understandable.

23
00:00:39,366 --> 00:00:42,096
(Bernadette:)Amy was afraid to tell her mom
she broke up with Sheldon.

24
00:00:42,102 --> 00:00:43,272
(Penny:)Yeah?
How did it go?

25
00:00:43,270 --> 00:00:44,540
(Penny:)Did she make you crawl

26
00:00:44,537 --> 00:00:46,067
(Penny:)into the breaking-up drawer?

27
00:00:47,706 --> 00:00:49,306
(Amy:)Uh, well, actually,
to be honest...

28
00:00:49,309 --> 00:00:50,869
I-I haven't told her yet.

29
00:00:50,868 --> 00:00:52,638
(Penny:)You've been giving me
a hard time

30
00:00:52,636 --> 00:00:54,606
(Penny:)and you haven't even told
your mom about Sheldon?

31
00:00:54,973 --> 00:00:56,773
(Amy:)I'm feeling a little dizzy
from all the blood loss.

